  "Solution": {
    "S": "In cisplatin, the complex is [Pt(NH₃)₂Cl₂]. Platinum is bonded to two ammonia molecules and two chloride ions, making a total of four coordinate bonds. Hence, the coordination number of Pt is 4. The correct option is A."
